This is deliberate and it is the only part of the project licensed this way.
The firmware, the VCV Rack plugin and the tooling are GPL-3.0-or-later, and the
hardware design under hardware/ is CERN-OHL-S v2 — both chosen so the module can
be built, studied, forked and improved by anyone. The artwork is reserved so
that the result of doing so is not a visually identical module sold as if it
were ours. Fork the module; draw your own front.

